/api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amitanandaiyer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/399130143","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/341#issuecomment-399130143","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/341","id":399130143,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM5OTEzMDE0Mw==","user":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk","html_url":"https://github.com/kmuthukk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-06-21T14:47:29Z","updated_at":"2018-06-21T15:28:32Z","body":"Firstly, regarding your note: <<< Thank you so much for opening this great project.^_^. >>>\r\n\r\nWe thank you for your feedback! Appreciate it. \r\n\r\nOne thing I want to mention is that in our recommended deployment mode (whether it be for [local dev testing ](https://docs.yugabyte.com/latest/quick-start/create-local-cluster/) or production style [multi-node deployments](https://docs.yugabyte.com/latest/deploy/)), the only two server side processes of interest are yb-master & yb-tserver. The functionality of yb-cqlserver is essentially bundled into the yb-tserver itself, and the yb-cqlserver does not need to be run separately and is no longer heavily tested.\r\n\r\nEach node's TServer process itself listens to a Cassandra & Redis compatible protocol natively and implements the YCQL & YEDIS compiler/execution engines in a embedded manner. [There is no need to separately run the yb-cqlserver process.] For an architectural overview of yb-tserver process and its sub-components, see [here](https://docs.yugabyte.com/latest/architecture/concepts/universe/#yb-tserver).\r\n\r\nFor example, you can start a yb-tserver and specify gflags for which port you want to listen to the YCQL & YEDIS protocols on:\r\n```\r\n./yb-tserver --tserver_master_addrs $IP:7100 --fs_data_dirs $DATA_DIRS --cql_proxy_bind_address $IP:9042 --redis_proxy_bind_address $IP:6379 >& /mnt/disk1/yb-data/tserver.out &\r\n```\r\nHaving said that, we'll look into this error, and report back. [CC'ing @amitanandaiyer for this input.] \r\n\r\n@wqxiang88  - Is there a particular reason you want to run the YCQL query layer/engine outside as a separate process rather than the in-process embedded default inside of the yb-tserver process?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/399130143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk","html_url":"https://github.com/kmuthukk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.